{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexussnapshot"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Snapshots","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentSerializationError","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceResolver","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityReferenceError"],"anchor":"Snapshots"}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NexusSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NexusSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS13NexusSnapshotV","title":"NexusSnapshot","roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"text":"An encodable view of the entities of a nexus and their serializable components.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/Member"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/entityIdGenerator","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/members"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/Encodable-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NexusSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A snapshot references the live components and entity identifier generator of the nexus. Encode it right after creation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encoded form starts with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion","isActive":true},{"text":" and lists all entities in ascending identifier order,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each with its original identifier (the raw value, here with generation 0) and its components keyed by their stable ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["{","  \"formatVersion\": 3,","  \"entityIdGenerator\": { \"nextFreshId\": 3, \"recycledIds\": [] },","  \"entities\": [","    { \"id\": 1, \"components\": { \"MyGame.Position\": { \"x\": 1, \"y\": 2 } } },","    { \"id\": 2, \"components\": {}, \"sharedComponents\": { \"MyGame.Position\": 1 } }","  ]","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" is present if the generator of the nexus is a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sharedComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" is present for entities that share a component instance with an entity listed before them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Components are values since 2.0, so snapshots never write it; it is still read from older data."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It maps the component type name to the identifier of the entity that encodes the instance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Version history:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1: Entities and their components."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2: Adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sharedComponents"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3: Entity identifiers are encoded as 64 bit raw values holding the slot index and generation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The generator state lists recycled identifiers as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"recycledIds"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Snapshots of versions 1 and 2 still load. Their identifiers decode with generation 0.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The slot index 0 is reserved and never used for entities, so an entity with index 0 in an older snapshot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gets a fresh identifier when the snapshot is restored, and references to it are remapped to that identifier.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"All other entities keep their identifiers.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/SE","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/s9EscapableP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NonSerializableComponentHandling":{"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nonserializablecomponenthandling","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NonSerializableComponentHandling"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling","kind":"symbol","title":"NonSerializableComponentHandling","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines how exporting a nexus snapshot treats components that are not serializable."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NonSerializableComponentHandling","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/persistableentityidentifiergenerator","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An entity identifier generator whose state can be saved in a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","title":"PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","type":"topic"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","url":"\/